# Release deploy gate

Before merging any PR that changes `release/version.json` or announcing an in-app update is live:

1. Run `.\release\pre-deploy-check.ps1` from repo root (use `-WaitForCi` if tag `v*` was just pushed).
2. Do **not** merge unless it passes.

## Tag + CI flow (default)

1. Push tag `vX.Y.Z` → wait for `release-apk.yml` to finish.
2. `.\release\publish-release.ps1 -PinManifestOnly` — pins hash from live download only; never uploads over CI.
3. `.\release\pre-deploy-check.ps1 -WaitForCi` — required before manifest PR merge.

## Never

- Pin `expectedSha256` from local APK when CI may upload afterward.
- Run `publish-release.ps1` without `-PinManifestOnly` when release already exists (unless `-Upload` is intentional).
- Push tag after pinning manifest from a local upload.

See `release/RELEASE.md` for the full checklist.
